WEBVTT

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.917
and the unequal division
of wealth and power.

00:09:32.208 --> 00:09:36.083
Fragility gives racial inequality a pass.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.809
Who are the winners and losers?

00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:41.500
Well look at the data.

00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:45.268
In income.

00:09:45.292 --> 00:09:46.976
In health inequalities.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.726
In school exclusion.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.309
In career prospects.

00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:52.309
In stop and search.

00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:54.976
Look at how people of color

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.375
have been disproportionately
dying of COVID.